    "description": "Search emails by subject, sender, and/or date range. Returns matching emails from all accounts, except mail in Junk, Spam, Trash, Deleted Messages, Sent Messages, Sent Mail, Drafts or Outbox, which it never returns. At least one search criterion (subject, sender, after, before) is required.",
    "inputSchema": {
